    "problems": "The study tests SAE latents rather than individual neurons, so it does not directly establish neuron-level interpretability shares. The semantic audit has inter-judge κ = 0.50, and the same-side ceiling was judged related in 75% of items. The causal intervention study uses 12 held-out active contexts per latent and does not evaluate explanation predictions on held-out firing examples.",
    "rows_left_out": "No other results were extracted: reconstruction, sparsity, calibration, synthetic benchmarks, and training-collapse analyses do not directly measure a listed claim version or the related semantic-audit and sign-conditioned-intervention outcomes.",
